{"success":1,"query_summary":{"num_reviews":39,"review_score":5,"review_score_desc":"Mixed","total_positive":26,"total_negative":13,"total_reviews":39},"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"152675268","author":{"steamid":"76561198138270427","personaname":"~Riv~","persona_status":"online","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198138270427/","num_games_owned":0,"num_reviews":8,"playtime_forever":259,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":259,"last_played":1701462773,"avatar":"31cbe221107ff3873922fbfc1cb93b6dcb029a13"},"language":"english","review":"[h1]More Potential than Game[/h1]\n\nAlthough i can't recommend this game in it's current state (not even with the $10 price tag.), it is kinda fun. It's potential is orders of magnitude above what it currently is. \n\n[h3]Pros:[/h3]\n\n- DRIPPING with potential to be an incredibly fun sandbox.\n\n- The physics of the individual pieces of trash is good, and probably one of the most entertaining things about this game. \n\n- The physics of the bins is very reminiscent of other \"broken physics\" games in a good way. a raccoon yeeting a full sized herby curby across a street in a single slap is entertaining.\n\n- The animation and art style, although both janky, is very charming.\n\n- jumping is appropriately responsive and is the best thing about the controls.\n\n- I get to ruin imaginary Torontonians' day by throwing their bins everywhere.\n\n[h3]Cons:[/h3]\n\n- Incredibly shallow gameplay loop\n\n- The broken physics is not limited to being fun. Sometimes it's downright annoying.\n\n- Constant graphical/object instantiation glitches break immersion. Whether it's cars half under a road, food \"eatboxes\" being unreachable, or atrocious camera collision.\n\n- physics are limited to bins and their contents. nothing else does anything.\n\n- The controls leave much to be desired and most button actions feel meaningless. \n\n- Movement itself is ok, but as movement makes up 90% of the core mechanics, it should be much, much deeper. \n\n- mechanics are minimal. Walk. Run. Climb. duck under parked cars. Stand up. Slap garbage bins. scatter the contents. Eat. Eat sparkly powerups. [spoiler] Get stared at by a coywolf at [/spoiler] arbitrary boundaries (that force an invisible wall). Garbage trucks take bins sometimes. Other raccoons challenge you to a race to knock x amount of bins over.\n\n- The powerups feel exceptionally bad. They were funny the first time got them, but there are only two and their novelty was entirely worn out after a few times each. Both are unresponsive, largely unfun, and force unnecessary changes to movement mechanics. You have to wait for them to time themselves out until you can get back to the better default movement.\n\nI want this game to be good. I Want to love it. I love the concept. I really hope the Dev works towards fulfilling this potential.","timestamp_created":1701465548,"timestamp_updated":1701465548,"voted_up":false,"votes_up":51,"votes_funny":2,"weighted_vote_score":"0.83545154333114624","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"150203965","author":{"steamid":"76561198000257233","personaname":"thePadlockesTech","persona_status":"offline","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/lockedown5000/","num_games_owned":0,"num_reviews":12,"playtime_forever":19,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":19,"last_played":1700106076,"avatar":"4cad64e04d6eed15a75f1e52ec140d6bc45e3165"},"language":"english","review":"This is a fun little game. I've only played in the first neighborhood but it was fun tipping over trash bins and eating garbage. Also, I'm not going to spoil anything, but eating certain things have cool effects. \n\nYou can definitely tell it is a first game, but it is quite a good job for a first in my opinion. Good work!","timestamp_created":1700106307,"timestamp_updated":1700106307,"voted_up":true,"votes_up":20,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.730032086372375488","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[{"reaction_type":2,"count":1}]},{"recommendationid":"152817211","author":{"steamid":"76561197970329454","personaname":"Turbo Donkey","persona_status":"online","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/turbodonkey/","num_games_owned":944,"num_reviews":8,"playtime_forever":11,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":11,"last_played":1701623529,"avatar":"bfe53bc553cd6a84c5cdee179e51d5e04f0fc803"},"language":"english","review":"I saw other reviews before I bought his game, and was not expecting much, and I have to say that my very low expectations were not met. This is basically a pre-alpha demo. There's no actual game here at all, no explanation of what to do, no story, no meaningful goals. The only thing there is to do is to knock bins over and eat garbage. I know, that sounds great, but it gets old in about 30 seconds. There are some very very very basic errors and awful jankiness that absolutely must be addressed before anyone should be asked to part with money for this. It feels like a game jam entry that ran out of time.\n\nThe idea is brilliant. It could be super charming. The animation is very raccoony. I'm not going to refund, because I want to support the developer. But really, if you buy this, be aware that you are simply donating your money - you must expect nothing in return.\n\nIt's possible that this could become fun in the future. I hope so. I am concerned, though, that it'll need a rewrite from the ground up. It's very clear that there have been some very questionable architecture decisions, that will only be cured with cleansing fire.","timestamp_created":1701624193,"timestamp_updated":1701624193,"voted_up":false,"votes_up":27,"votes_funny":1,"weighted_vote_score":"0.714521288871765137","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"150222435","author":{"steamid":"76561197988299635","personaname":"Evilkinevils","persona_status":"online","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/evilkinevils/","num_games_owned":399,"num_reviews":96,"playtime_forever":64,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":60,"last_played":1700216030,"avatar":"13973e092c7ae2a6bce332ad00ddfee3a588194d"},"language":"english","review":"Gameplay: https://youtu.be/4d7vLx_9-Ns\n\nI love this, it's great fun to run around and trash the place, it's also really nice and peaceful just roaming around and seeing the sights. It'll be interesting to see what's added because there's a good variety at the moment but i think there's also potential to expand the scope a bit. I do think there needs to be a full map, and a way to travel faster because the large levels are pretty big. All up, pretty fun, worth a go!","timestamp_created":1700142006,"timestamp_updated":1700142006,"voted_up":true,"votes_up":8,"votes_funny":1,"weighted_vote_score":"0.621120810508728027","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"153255509","author":{"steamid":"76561198005443344","personaname":"SuperKimbit","persona_status":"in-game","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/superkimbit/","num_games_owned":932,"num_reviews":47,"playtime_forever":45,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":45,"last_played":1702168253,"avatar":"1f0550cfb8edad12cc80f844decf74d711ee3ea4"},"language":"english","review":"I love raccoons but this is a buggy mess with nothing to do.","timestamp_created":1702168486,"timestamp_updated":1702168486,"voted_up":false,"votes_up":11,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.630101263523101807","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":false,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"161458561","author":{"steamid":"76561198126021512","personaname":"I am Dolan","persona_status":"offline","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/iamthedolan/","num_games_owned":1045,"num_reviews":19,"playtime_forever":482,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":482,"deck_playtime_at_review":427,"last_played":1711397475,"avatar":"03c1055c2ced3622d28cedc5972be3b1578fb915"},"language":"english","review":"I hate leaving bad reviews and I want to love this game / recommend it to everyone but right now I just can’t. It’s a game that has so much potential but it needs so much work to it. If this can progress into a goat simulator style game where you can cause more havoc as a raccoon than just running around a dark city knocking over bins to get an irrelevant score it would be so much fun. \n\nThe game itself is so glitchy and buggy, cars / houses spawning through the map, in the air or on their side. Sometimes the map itself just doesn’t load and you fall down it and have to start that map again. The raccoons you challenge to see who can knock over the most bins first would actually be a fun aspect if those raccoons didn’t stay floating in the air letting you win. \n\nI’ve sunk so many hours into this trying to achieve the achievements to find out that 4 of them are currently unobtainable because the maps aren’t even created yet. The Swansea level I can’t even complete because the bins don’t spawn when challenging the raccoon. It’s a nice game but loses appeal within 5 minutes because there is quite literally nothing to do. \n\nThings I wish it had: \n- a full map you can view to see what roads / bins you’ve missed. \n- multiplayer \n- power ups to actually do something fun than fart fire or glow whilst floating. \n- more things to go, other NCP’s around that actually do things or you can interact with. \n- time cycles so you’re not just playing in the dark all the time\n- other objects to interact with\n- more diverse scenery that’s not the same 4 trees and a square house that are all the same colours. \n- score board / leader boards that actually make getting a score mean something. \n- more actions for the raccoon because 80% of buttons are useless. \n\nMy only over gripe is playing this on the steamdeck / with a controller, the default settings mean run is the X button which is a real nightmare to control the camera angle as you’re running. I know this can be changed in the configuration settings but I just can’t see the logic behind having the default this way.\n\nI don’t know, if you’re desperate to play it then you do you but I really wouldn’t waste your money like I have in the state it’s in now…","timestamp_created":1711398395,"timestamp_updated":1711398395,"voted_up":false,"votes_up":4,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.569641590118408203","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":true,"timestamp_dev_responded":1713215975,"developer_response":"Hi there Dolan!\nI really appreciate your well thought out review. I'm taking it to heart. As I continue to tinker with this game, I'm going to pay close attention to what you've shared.\n\nCheers,\n  Jason","app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"152886251","author":{"steamid":"76561198137402556","personaname":"scringly","persona_status":"in-game","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198137402556/","num_games_owned":429,"num_reviews":13,"playtime_forever":126,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":32,"last_played":1701859626,"avatar":"67a7c5f85a1eeec212f6eaa9d5cc18053d99df4d"},"language":"english","review":"Gameplay is very simple and not very expansive, knocking over bins to eat the garbage. While I don't hate this or anything its novelty wears off pretty quickly as there's minimal variety to either the bins or their contents. The various neighbourhoods also lack personality, i feel less like a raccoon walking through suburban toronto and more like im walking through a collection of basic house and tree models. I will stress that there is a lot of potential but i do not believe it is worth buying in its current state, the climbing controls and general physics especially leave a lot to be desired. I won't be refunding it however, I truly think theres a good game here it just needs some TLC (and some objectives/goals) to really capture people.\n\ntldr: Game has a lot of potential but I cannot recommend it with how little there is to do currently.","timestamp_created":1701719428,"timestamp_updated":1701719428,"voted_up":false,"votes_up":7,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.567461311817169189","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"163788783","author":{"steamid":"76561198104061899","personaname":"Krullness","persona_status":"offline","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198104061899/","num_games_owned":1086,"num_reviews":13,"playtime_forever":204,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":131,"last_played":1733515208,"avatar":"d2ea71eada1e134c5fa701fe822848a2ec51b9ae"},"language":"english","review":"This game has potential to be a lot of fun , but at the moment it is really lack luster. There really isn't much to do other then run around and knock over trash cans and open boxes of food left out. Sure you can climb stuff like trees and houses but there's no point. No hidden objects or points of interest. It is a very good representation of what being a raccoon is, but after about 10 minutes it's rather boring. While some of the maps are quite large there's just what I listed to do. Most fun I had was trying to beat the trash truck to cans, but even it has a set path and just keeps looping.","timestamp_created":1714324579,"timestamp_updated":1714324579,"voted_up":false,"votes_up":3,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.553098738193511963","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"168018861","author":{"steamid":"76561198151456376","personaname":"canuck1975","persona_status":"offline","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/canuck1975/","num_games_owned":109,"num_reviews":10,"playtime_forever":18,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":18,"last_played":1719061836,"avatar":"235e6e10cd66af9a6c42020f8053cf3a32508522"},"language":"english","review":"The potential is here but the game has a long way to go before it's playable and viable. Really, the only people who probably would be interested in this, are Torontonians and those around them.","timestamp_created":1719158387,"timestamp_updated":1719158387,"voted_up":true,"votes_up":2,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.540229856967926025","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"150209406","author":{"steamid":"76561199184402463","personaname":"Melosaurs","persona_status":"online","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/Melosaurs/","num_games_owned":0,"num_reviews":4,"playtime_forever":48,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":7,"last_played":1714639056,"avatar":"cd2ae01cc7a1069a35fb7391f0c0b007b451afda"},"language":"english","review":"OH MY GOSH. This game is everything and I won't ruin too much of this game but it's a great chill game to knock over trash cans and be a raccoon. Certain things give you powers and it's so unexpected. 10/10 would recommend.","timestamp_created":1700117727,"timestamp_updated":1700117727,"voted_up":true,"votes_up":7,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.528992354869842529","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"162076420","author":{"steamid":"76561199663861147","personaname":"PomPokoFrites","persona_status":"offline","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/pomopokofrites/","num_games_owned":0,"num_reviews":1,"playtime_forever":98,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":98,"last_played":1712106138,"avatar":"c008bd5cee0dcaf1d646828409e1c89539950ef8"},"language":"english","review":"I love this game. I have some suggestions for mods.","timestamp_created":1712106308,"timestamp_updated":1712106308,"voted_up":true,"votes_up":1,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.523809552192687988","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"150326672","author":{"steamid":"76561199234193212","personaname":"RabbiLawrence","persona_status":"online","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199234193212/","num_games_owned":0,"num_reviews":29,"playtime_forever":114,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":91,"last_played":1700274036,"avatar":"ec8b133c76fac5c571f2738cb295b8895c1f09ce"},"language":"english","review":"Awesome game. A few glitches here and there but overall i love it. I highly recommend especially if you want to play a casual game. sometimes you cant hit a garbage can on a major road like queen street cause it stops you. I hope to see that fixed but otherwise awesome. i also like the nemesis challenges. it would be cool if you had to avoid moving cars too","timestamp_created":1700273449,"timestamp_updated":1700595206,"voted_up":true,"votes_up":2,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.523809552192687988","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":false,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"152810912","author":{"steamid":"76561199157528143","personaname":"Sora_Takenouchi","persona_status":"online","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199157528143/","num_games_owned":91,"num_reviews":7,"playtime_forever":28,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":28,"last_played":1701618268,"avatar":"049116dc3827584518d1124b90aa06b7fab8d023"},"language":"english","review":"Honestly the games got a lot of potential but it's really not fun after about 10ish minuets.","timestamp_created":1701618537,"timestamp_updated":1701618537,"voted_up":false,"votes_up":8,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":"0.566524803638458252","comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"204909153","author":{"steamid":"76561198054898322","personaname":"Death Kitten","persona_status":"offline","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/diziara/","num_games_owned":0,"num_reviews":11,"playtime_forever":231,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":231,"last_played":1720730407,"avatar":"09d96a6a008a7fbe3e9299e5690e84f70d73eec2"},"language":"english","review":"Get this one on sale if you're looking at it. The idea's cute, the controls need some polishing, and it needs a bit more content than just knocking over trash cans and making a mess. It's certainly a way to spend some time just vibing, but not at full price.","timestamp_created":1758494627,"timestamp_updated":1758494627,"voted_up":true,"votes_up":0,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":0.5,"comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"160640628","author":{"steamid":"76561198074731686","personaname":"ohookins","persona_status":"offline","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074731686/","num_games_owned":0,"num_reviews":24,"playtime_forever":644,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":316,"last_played":1747284929,"avatar":"fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"},"language":"english","review":"Nice idea and the I like the vibe, but sadly the game lacks any depth at all. The different maps don't really add much, and the core mechanic is basically discovered and mastered within the first few minutes. Then it's just grinding to tip over all the bins.\r\n\r\nSimilarly, I appreciate that it's \"lo-fi\" but the paths/grass/roads/etc could really do with some textures, even some simple procedural materials, rather than just a plain albedo colour.","timestamp_created":1710566519,"timestamp_updated":1710566519,"voted_up":false,"votes_up":0,"votes_funny":0,"weighted_vote_score":0.5,"comment_count":0,"steam_purchase":true,"received_for_free":false,"refunded":false,"written_during_early_access":false,"primarily_steam_deck":false,"app_release_date":"1700096749","reactions":[]},{"recommendationid":"160305003","author":{"steamid":"76561198042846072","personaname":"TheWingedLlama","persona_status":"offline","profile_url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/thewingedllama/","num_games_owned":0,"num_reviews":19,"playtime_forever":37,"playtime_last_two_weeks":0,"playtime_at_review":37,"last_played":1710122604,"avatar":"3f23a7f9bc3004444065ce8168cb601f21ce27f2"},"language":"english","review":"A uniquely Canadian viewpoint that could have had the potential